Vehicle.CurrentLocation.ReferencePosition.X:
  datatype: int16
  type: attribute
  unit: mm
  description: Reference position of vehicle location. Axis definitions according to ISO 8855. Origin at center of (first) rear axle.
               Positive values = forward of rear axle. Negative values = backward of rear axle.
Vehicle.CurrentLocation.ReferencePosition.Y:
  datatype: int16
  type: attribute
  unit: mm
  description: Reference position of vehicle location. Axis definitions according to ISO 8855. Origin at center of (first) rear axle.
               Positive values = left of origin. Negative values = right of origin.
               Left/Right is as seen from driver perspective, i.e. by a person looking forward.
Vehicle.CurrentLocation.ReferencePosition.Z:
  datatype: int16
  type: attribute
  unit: mm
  description: Reference position of vehicle location on Z-axis. Axis definitions according to ISO 8855. Origin at center of (first) rear axle. 
               Positive values = above center of rear axle. Negative values = below center of rear axle.
